          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAY_SHORTAGES",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771489182671",
          "id": "1765992929801",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765992929802_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use `MaterialShortageDataArray` having value `{{$context.$variables.MaterialShortageDataArray}}` \nEach row contains data for WorkOrderId, WorkOrderNumber, WorkOrderDescription, AssetNumber, WoStatusName, WorkCenter, MaterialAvailableStatus, DistinctItemShortages, TotalShortageQuantity\n\n\n- If `MaterialShortageDataArray` is null or empty and data is not found return below :\n  - Define only one column `Information` with only 1 below row\n  - `No Material Shortage found for Work Orders in time period.`\n- Under no circumstances should you ask for further clarification or request user input if no events are present. Only display the message.\n\n- If shortages are found:\n - Display the data as a table, with columns as  Work Order Number, Work Order Description (wrap if necessary), Asset Number, Work Order Status, Item Shortages, Material Available Status(`None` with priority alert, for `ORA_N` and `Partial` with priority warning for `ORA_P`)\n - set `title` of the list as `Item shortages for work orders`\n - Do not show TotalShortageQuantity in the response.\n - Show up to 10 records in decreasing order of DistinctItemShortages, and then TotalShortageQuantity\n - Value of OrganizationId is {{$context.$variables.OrganizationId}} \n -  Add drill down link : `drillDownAction` as ora.Invoke(actionMaterialShortageNav) and pass below JSON payload\n   -\"OrganizationId\": {{$context.$variables.OrganizationId}} , \"WorkOrderNumber\":`WorkOrderNumber`\n\n- Return only the table. \n- Set the overall `title` as below:\n  - Material Readiness Detailed Breakdown, indicating the time range from {{$context.$variables.StartDate}} to {{$context.$variables.EndDate}} in natural language, without specific dates, where current date is {{$context.$system.$currentDate}} . eg. `Material Readiness — Detailed Breakdown (Past 30 Days to Next 7 Days)`\n- Do not include any internal identifiers or extra commentary."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_SCM_MAINTENANC_MATERIALASSIGNMENTSUMMARIES",
            "functionName": "oraScmMnt_materialAssignmentSummary_dynamicParam",
            "name": "Get Item Shortages"
