          "code": "ITEM_SHORTAGE_DISPLAY",
          "id": "1771489609227",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771489609228_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "- Use `MaterialShortage` Array having value :  `{{$context.$nodes.GET_ITEM_SHORTAGE_ADDITIONAL_DATA.$output}}` and display Item Shortages.\nEach row contains data for InventoryItemId, OrganizationId, ItemNumber,I temDescription, UOM, RequiredQuantity, OpenQuantity, OperationDescription, ShortageQuantity, OrgsWithStock, LeadTime\n\n- If `MaterialShortage` is null or empty and data is not found return below :\n  - Define only one column `Information` with only 1 below row\n  - `No Material Shortage found in time period.`\n- Under no circumstances should you ask for further clarification or request user input if no events are present. Only display the message.\n\n- If shortages are found, for each Item shortage:\n - Display the data as a table\n   - In non-expanded mode:  show only 5 columns: Item, Open Qty, Shortage Qty, UOM,Recommendation\n   - In expanded mode: show these columns in same order: Item, Required Qty, Open Qty, Shortage Qty, UOM, Lead Time, Orgs with Stocks, Item Description(wrap if necessary), Recommendation\n - set `title` of the list as `Item shortages  across work orders`\n - Show up to 10 records in decreasing order of ShortageQuantity,\n - Recommendation\n  - Where there are others orgs with stock (OrgsWithStock>0) then recommend text \"Request Transfer\" \n  - Where there is no 'Substitute Item' and no 'Orgs With Stock', then recommend text \"Requisition Part\"\n  - No recommendation when Shortage is 0.\n\n- Return only the table and actionable insights. \n- Set the overall `title` : `Current Material Shortages — All Open Items`\n- Do not include any internal identifiers or extra commentary."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
